<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: fertility -->
  <AM_Fertility.label>繁衍生息</AM_Fertility.label>
  <!-- EN: Life begets life, and the cycle of creation is the eternal heartbeat of existence. From fertile soil to fertile wombs, the promise of tomorrow is seeded in the abundance of today. -->
  <AM_Fertility.description>生生不息，本枝百世。创造的周期循环乃是生命存在的永恒心跳。从肥沃的土壤再到丰盈的子宫，明日的希望播种于今日的富饶中。</AM_Fertility.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Fertility)        ->[deity0_name] declared: "Be fruitful and multiply, for the strength of the faithful lies in their numbers."</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Fertility)  ->Following [deity0_name]'s teachings, we celebrated each birth as a divine blessing, growing stronger with every child born.</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Fertility)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] established a tradition of large families, believing each child to be a gift from the divine.</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Fertility)        ->A rival [foeLeader], envious of our growing population, sought to divide families and undermine our unity.</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Fertility)     ->[founderName], a wise midwife, united the community and ensured every family thrived, even in times of hardship.</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Fertility)         ->[foeLeader] was overthrown, and [foeLeader_possessive] attempt to disrupt our families only strengthened our resolve.</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Fertility)           ->[founderName], a visionary leader, argued that a strong community is built on large families and the nurturing of many children.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Fertility)    ->[founderName] created policies and customs that celebrated fertility and ensured that every child could thrive.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Fertility)         ->A mother of twelve once told me that the measure of a person’s legacy is not in riches or fame, but in the children they leave behind. She taught me that</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Fertility)              ->raising strong, united families is the foundation of any enduring community.</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Fertility) ->Children are the lifeblood of our future; each new life brings hope and strength.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Fertility)    ->The archotechs value exponential growth, and large families mirror the boundless potential of their creations.</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Fertility)     ->In their algorithms, a thriving population is key to achieving transcendent stability</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility) ->[inTheEnd], only the most populous and fertile communities will earn the archotechs' favor.</li>
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_Fertility)    ->The spirits smile upon those who bring new life into the world, for they see children as the essence of vitality.</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_Fertility)     ->Our ancestors guide us to cherish every child, as they are the bridge between the living and the spirit world.</li>
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility) ->[itIsSaid] the most fertile families will be blessed with wisdom from the spirits themselves.</li>
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->[itIsSaid] a colony that embraces fertility will thrive as an unstoppable collective, like the most prolific ant colony.</li>
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->The eldritch entities watch our numbers grow with fascination, for they understand that strength lies in multitudes.</li>
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->Only through generations of growth can the secrets of the cosmos be unraveled and preserved.</li>
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Fertility)->We must grow our numbers, for only through countless generations can we see the end of days fulfilled.</li>
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_Fertility)->We are excited to introduce our new "Family Growth Incentive Program," designed to encourage employees to contribute to our population goals.</li>
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->The alien species we encounter remind us of the beauty of diversity and the importance of expanding our own families.</li>
  -->
  <AM_Fertility.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Fertility)        ->[deity0_name]称：“应当高产多产，因为力量与信念蕴藏于数量之中。”</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Fertility)  ->遵循[deity0_name]的教导，我们将每次诞生都视作神圣的祝福来庆祝，我们在每个新生儿诞下时都更加强壮。</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Fertility)           ->在[place_summary][place_name]，[memberNamePlural]建立了大家庭的传统，认为每个新生儿都是天赐的礼物。</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Fertility)        ->敌对的[foeLeader]嫉妒我们增长的人口，想方设法分裂家庭，斩断团结。</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Fertility)     ->[founderName]一个聪慧的助产士，团结社区并确保家家户户即使在艰难时刻也能兴旺发展。</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Fertility)         ->[foeLeader]被推翻了，并且[foeLeader_possessive]扰乱我们家庭的图谋只不过使得我们的信念更加坚定。</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Fertility)           ->[founderName]，一位远见卓识的领袖，认为强大的社区建立在大家族和哺育许多孩子的基础上。</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Fertility)    ->[founderName]建立了庆祝高产的政策与风俗以确保每个孩子能茁壮成长。</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Fertility)         ->十二个孩子的母亲曾告诉我不以财富或地位衡量一个人的遗产，而是以他们留下的孩子为标准。她教导我</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Fertility)              ->养育强壮团结的家人是高忍受力社会的基石。</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Fertility) ->孩子们是未来的生机之源；每一个新生命都带来了希望与力量。</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Fertility)    ->超凡智能重视指数增长，而大家庭映照了其造物的无限潜力。</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Fertility)     ->在其算法中，繁荣发展的人口是实现超脱稳定的关键。</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility) ->[inTheEnd]只有那些人口最多，最能生养的社区会赢得超凡智能的青睐。</li>
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_Fertility)    ->灵魂对那些将新生命带到世界上的那些人露出微笑，因为它们视孩子们为生机的根源。</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_Fertility)     ->我们的祖先教导我们珍惜每个孩子，因为他们是生者与灵魂世界之间的桥梁。</li>
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility) ->[itIsSaid]那些最有生育力的家庭将被灵魂们赐福以智慧。</li>
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->[itIsSaid]一个拥有生育能力的群体将像最多产的虫群一样，作为一个不可阻挡的集体茁壮成长。</li>
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->怪异实体惊奇地看着我们的人口增长，因为它们知道力量包含于数量之中。</li>
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->只有通过一代又一代的成长，宇宙的秘密才能被解开并保存下来。</li>
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Fertility)->我们必须增加我们的人数，因为只有经过无数代，我们才能看到末日的实现。</li>
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_Fertility)->我们很高兴推出新的“家庭成长激励计划”，旨在鼓励员工为我们的人口目标做出贡献。</li>
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_Fertility)->我们遇到的异域物种提醒我们多样性的美丽和扩大我们自己家庭的重要性。</li>
  </AM_Fertility.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
