  <!-- EN: vampire hunting -->
  <AM_VampireHunting.label>血族狩猎</AM_VampireHunting.label>
  <!-- EN: We refuse to tolerate the predations of the sanguophages. These parasitic creatures thrive on the suffering of others, spreading their cursed condition like a plague. Our mission is clear: track them, eliminate them, and ensure their kind finds no safe haven under the stars. -->
  <AM_VampireHunting.description>我们绝不容忍那些血族的猎食行径。这些受诅咒的寄生虫就像瘟疫一样肆意增加同伴，并将族群存续建立在他人的痛苦和不幸之上。我们的任务很明确：追踪他们，歼灭他们，以及确保他们无法在群星间找到安全的立足之地。</AM_VampireHunting.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)        ->[deity0_name] gazed upon the cursed sanguophages and proclaimed: "These creatures are an affront to life itself. They must be purged to restore balance."</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)  ->[deity0_name] said to the [memberNamePlural]: "Hunt the sanguophages wherever they hide. Their bloodlust defiles the sanctity of creation."</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)           ->[memberNamePlural] constructed a solemn [altarName] on the [place_summary] [place_name], where they swore an oath to cleanse the land of sanguophages.</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)        ->The sanguophages retaliated against [deity0_name]'s followers, but the [memberNamePlural] stood firm, vowing to end their reign of terror.</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)     ->[deity0_name] commanded [founderName] to rise against the sanguophages, calling them the bane of mortal existence.</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)         ->[founderName] led a crusade against the sanguophages, vanquishing them and securing a lasting peace for the faithful.</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)           ->Our founder [founderName] was a visionary who saw the danger of sanguophages in [founder_possessive] world. [founder_pronoun] gathered [founder_possessive] followers and set out to eradicate this parasitic menace.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)    ->[founderName]'s followers documented [founder_possessive] tactics and strategies, passing down the art of sanguophage hunting through the generations.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)         ->In all my years tracking sanguophages, one truth has become clear:</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)              ->these creatures cannot coexist with humanity and must be eradicated for the safety of all</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting) ->Only by standing together and taking action can we protect ourselves from the sanguophage threat.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)    ->The archotechs have no tolerance for sanguophages. Their parasitic nature is an antithesis to perfection.</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)     ->When the archotechs reveal their grand design, those who stood against sanguophages will be rewarded for their vigilance.</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will eliminate all sanguophages and elevate the hunters who aided in their extermination.</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)     ->The spirits abhor sanguophages, for their thirst for blood disrupts the natural order of life and death.</li>
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->As predators prey upon the weak, so must we hunt the sanguophages to maintain the balance of the ecosystem.</li>
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->The sanguophages are a whisper of the cosmic madness that threatens to consume us all. By hunting them, we deny the abyss its agents.</li>
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->The sanguophages covet secrets that were never meant to be theirs. By ending their existence, we preserve the sacred knowledge of the unseen.</li>
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->The sanguophages herald the end. To delay the apocalypse, we must extinguish their cursed bloodlines.</li>
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->It has come to my attention that some of you have been avoiding assignments to hunt sanguophages. Let me remind you: no one is exempt from safeguarding our colony. Remember: teamwork keeps the parasites at bay!</li>
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->We will capture and study these creatures, learning from them and perhaps discover a way to better end the threat of sanguophages.</li>
  -->
  <AM_VampireHunting.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)        ->[deity0_name]怒视那些可憎的血族并称：“这些生物是对生命本身的侮辱。他们必须被清除以恢复平衡。”</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)  ->[deity0_name]对[memberNamePlural]说：“无论他们藏在哪里，猎尽血族。他们的嗜血玷污了造物的神圣。”</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)           ->[memberNamePlural]在[place_summary][place_name]建造了庄严的[altarName]，他们于此誓言净化血族。</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)        ->血族报复[deity0_name]的追随者，但[memberNamePlural]屹立不倒，誓言终结他们的恐怖统治。</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)     ->[deity0_name]命令[founderName]起身反抗血族，称他们祸害人间。</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)         ->[founderName]领导了对血族的十字军，打败他们，为信徒们争取持久的和平。</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)           ->我们的[founderName]高瞻远瞩，在[founder_possessive]眼中能看到血族的危险。[founder_pronoun]聚集了[founder_possessive]追随者并着手根除这种寄生威胁。</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)    ->[founderName]的追随者记录了[founder_possessive]战略战术，将血族猎人的技艺代代相传。</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)         ->在我追踪血族的这些年里，一个真相变得日渐明晰：</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)              ->这些生物无法与人类共存，为了所有人的安全，必须将血族一个不留的全部驱逐出去!</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting) ->只有肩并肩，采取行动，我们才能保护自己免受血族的威胁。</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)    ->超凡智能对血族零容忍，他们的寄生天性是完美的对立面。</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)     ->当超凡智能揭露祂们的宏伟计划时，那些反对血族的人将会因为他们的警惕而得到奖励。</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting) ->[inTheEnd]，超凡智能将消灭所有血族，并助力那些协助灭绝的猎人飞升。</li>
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)     ->灵魂憎恶血族，因为他们对血的渴望扰乱了自然的生死秩序。</li>
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->就像捕食者捕食弱者一样，我们也必须猎杀血族来维持生态系统的平衡。</li>
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->血族是威胁要吞噬我们所有人的宇宙疯狂之低语。通过追捕他们，我们就能阻止深渊的代理人。</li>
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->血族觊觎着本不属于他们的秘密。通过终结它们的存在，我们保存了关于未知世界的神圣知识。</li>
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->血族预示着终结。为了推迟末日，我们必须消灭他们该死的血统。</li>
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->我注意到你们中的一些人一直在逃避追捕血族的任务。让我提醒你们：没有人能免于保卫我们殖民地的责任。记住：团队合作让寄生虫远离我们！</li>
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_SanguophageHunting)->我们将捕获并研究这些生物，研究他们，也许能找到一种更好的方法来结束血族的威胁。</li>
  </AM_VampireHunting.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
